 ## Request and run observations
+
+OpenAI compatible models use 30 second connection and pool waits and 300 second
+read and write waits. Anthropic models use a 300 second request timeout. Both
+allow one SDK retry. Session header clients retain finite transport timeouts.
+These bound network silence, not the total duration of a stream that keeps
+producing data. Cancelling a model turn does not cancel background execution Jobs.
 
